  "suite_sha256": "b391cbd026543e92ebf88562c72764f95f7a2adee42f8a49ca23499304228073",
  "rationale": "These scenarios target common silent-failure boundaries not fully covered by the current suite: exact tenant/key matching, failed-reserve retryability, single-restoration release semantics, key binding conflicts on quantity changes, strict validation of invalid numeric/string inputs, and no-op behavior for unknown operations or extra fields. Each case is short, starts from a fresh service, and includes stock checks to reveal unintended state mutation.",
  "origin": "live OpenAI; fresh context, implementation withheld"
